Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reporting to Grand Elder
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elders Pu Lin, Gu Cheng and Kun Sang
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,have requested reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:01.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(493,517)}Qian Kun\NFighting Evil Sect Grand Elder\NMiddle stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grand Elder,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,should we go ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Fighting Evil Sect's territory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not to be messed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pu Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't a regular Foundation Establishment cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy is about to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,enter the Core Formation stage !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,After one day and one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,my flying sword's attacks are no longer as effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Ji Realm is only able to injure them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,but not kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems I only have a single card left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if the Underworld Ice Flame is strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's like a tree without roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using it like this will consume the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,at a very fast pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to risk it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grand Elder !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three more Core Formations have arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The leader is at Middle stage Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that reinforcements have arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't risk shattering my Core embryo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,to kill them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:04.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,you killed an Elder of our Fighting Evil Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how far you flee,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will still kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have one last idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it will be dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will all be over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Faster, I must go faster !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been 3 years
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I still haven't heard from him...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, he saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then he promised
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,to send me back to the Burning Fire Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he will ever come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did you stop running ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1627,501)}Wu Liu\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:46.04,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1671,510)}Da Tou (Big Head)\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,That young woman we just saw
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,belongs to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:49.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It just happened that I needed a cultivation furnace !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,When did such a formation appear here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since this formation can summon a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:05:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can't be ordinary...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kun Sang,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,try using your Thousand Peaks Seal Stamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This really is a good formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow Elders,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's attack this formation together !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Great Annihilation Talisman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,If not for your Flood Dragon armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would've died by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,His talisman is very powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,with his Middle stage Core Formation cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a grade 5 pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:26.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Refine the Heaven Separating Pill as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are they chasing you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,because of this furnace !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,We only have one way out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must refine the pill
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I can reach Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,We won't walk out of this cave alive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I'm not Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must succeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must succeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the formation breaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will all be over !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't just give up like this !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have the Demon Blood Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,We still have time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Heaven Separating Pill made from Demon Blood Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its effect isn't... as good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,But !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much longer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,can the formation hold ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If 5 Core Formations keep attacking it like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,no more than 4 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will reach Core Formation as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,523)\fad(800,800)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is no joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,it didn't break after 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Da Tou,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:57.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you want that woman, you need to deserve her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The formation... is gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's actually another formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let me handle this !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,At this distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be able to trap that brat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,by using the Immortal Trapping Net the moment he walks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this what you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that little bastard would be able to buy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that pill furnace for 100 000 high-quality spirit stones !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:51.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give it to me, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grand Elder, this pill furnace belongs to me now !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will definitely repay you later, what do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You wish !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you destroy that pill furnace !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're looking for death,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall grant your wish !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,He saved my life in the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am just repaying him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Step back !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,He killed a Core Formation cultivator in an instant !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster is he !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:10.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest person below Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(539,454)}Wang Lin\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,If none of you are hiding your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you can all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:52.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Run !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have never been afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,within South Dipper City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and only time in my life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I've been afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have some people to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:42.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:42.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:47.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:47.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:53.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:59.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:04.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:04.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:10.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:10.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:16.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:16.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:20.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:20.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:24.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:27.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.47,0:18:32.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:32.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:36.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:39.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:44.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:44.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:47.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:50.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
